<title>UK: Nomura sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International plc says it has issued 4,500 American-style AIR (Accrue Interest in Range) corridor warrants, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $55.14		    PAY DATE     16.APR.97</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.APR.97-21.APR.98   LISTING	LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	     LOWER BARRIER LEVEL 17129.64</p>
<p>		     UPPER BARRIER LEVEL 20735.88</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
